DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/modality-case-study-implement
 ing-ai-clinical-practice\n報名/票券: https://stanford.zoom.us/webinar/
 register/WN_I1t4vA50SfKKUcGDTQq1aQ\n\nJoin us on November 4\, 12–1pm PT 
 for a roundtable discussion exploring what it takes to move an AI-enabled 
 behavioral health tool from development into real-world clinical practice\
 , using Modality as a case study. Speakers from Modality\, clinical partne
 r Cornerstone Treatment Facilities Network\, and research partner Stanford
  University will discuss how teams build trust and organizational buy-in\,
  integrate new tools into existing workflows\, and navigate challenges rel
 ated to adoption\, usability\, privacy\, safety\, and potential bias. The 
 conversation will also highlight the roles of clinical\, technical\, resea
 rch\, and implementation partners\, lessons from real-world deployment\, a
 nd ongoing efforts to understand engagement\, fidelity\, and impact over t
 ime - offering a behind-the-scenes look at what it takes to move promising
  technology toward meaningful\, sustainable use in practice.
